# uncalled `Bag.snapshot` copies an `ArrayList(T)` only in its
# definition-time trial, at an open type parameter, and is left alone too
# (issues/fixed/2026-10-17-explicit-copy-migration-rewrites-a-generic-body-seen-at-one-type.md).
# The expected_tree pins main.yo unchanged, and the trailing `check` proves it
# still evaluates.
